# Back link — one style only

## Visual etalon (hard)

Same as **unit hubs** (`unit1.html`, `unit1-listening/index.html` → `← Unit 1`):

- text `#5ec8f0`
- fill `rgba(10, 20, 38, 0.45)`
- border `1px solid rgba(94, 200, 240, 0.28)`
- `border-radius: 999px`
- **font-size `0.9rem`**, **padding `8px 12px`**
- hover: border stronger + `background: rgba(94, 200, 240, 0.1)`
- no underline / purple

## Forbidden

- Smaller “compact” variants (`0.8rem`, `4px 11px`)
- Bright solid teal fills (`#1c3850`, `#244962`, `#346c8c`) that make exercise pages look different from hubs
- Per-page `.back` overrides

